### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FoggyUrbanIntersection" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :hasEvidence :evidence1 .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition ;
    :description "Heavy fog reducing visibility beyond 20 meters" .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Vehicle partially obscured by fog in intersection" .

:evidence1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Fog obscures visibility of vehicle and surrounding environment" ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1, :risk2 .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "High occlusion risk due to fog, increasing collision potential" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential collision risk with obscured vehicle in intersection" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.88"^^xsd:float .
```

